{
  "id": "u52",
  "section": 7,
  "order": 4,
  "title": "Bazaar bargaining",
  "teTitle": "బజార్ బేరం",
  "cefr": "B1",
  "register": "hyderabad",
  "description": "Laad Bazaar bangle shopping — kam karo, the walking-away trick, and closing at the aakhri rate.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "u52-i01",
      "te": "లాడ్ బజార్ ఎటు వైపు?",
      "gloss": "Which way is Laad Bazaar?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "లాడ్", "gloss": "Laad" },
        { "te": "బజార్", "gloss": "bazaar" },
        { "te": "ఎటు", "gloss": "which way" },
        { "te": "వైపు", "gloss": "side / direction" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "questions"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "Laad Bazaar, the centuries-old bangle lane right next to Charminar — 'laad' is lacquer, the shiny coating on the bangles."
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i02",
      "te": "ఈ గాజులు ఎంత భయ్?",
      "gloss": "How much are these bangles, bhai?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఈ", "gloss": "these" },
        { "te": "గాజులు", "gloss": "bangles" },
        { "te": "ఎంత", "gloss": "how much" },
        { "te": "భయ్", "gloss": "bhai (brother)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "questions"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u52-i06", "u52-i15"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i03",
      "te": "కొంచెం కమ్ కరో భయ్.",
      "gloss": "Reduce it a little, bhai.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little" },
        { "te": "కమ్", "gloss": "less (Urdu)" },
        { "te": "కరో", "gloss": "make / do (Urdu)" },
        { "te": "భయ్", "gloss": "bhai (brother)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "bargaining"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "కమ్ కరో is straight Urdu ('make it less') dropped into Telugu — the standard equivalent is తగ్గించు. In the old city, the mix IS the language.",
      "distractors": ["u52-i12", "u52-i04"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i04",
      "te": "ఆఖరి రేటు చెప్పు అన్నా.",
      "gloss": "Tell me the final rate, anna.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఆఖరి", "gloss": "final (Urdu)" },
        { "te": "రేటు", "gloss": "rate" },
        { "te": "చెప్పు", "gloss": "tell" },
        { "te": "అన్నా", "gloss": "anna (brother)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "bargaining"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "ఆఖరి (aakhri, Urdu) = last/final — standard Telugu చివరి. ఆఖరి రేటు is the checkpoint question before you commit or walk.",
      "distractors": ["u52-i03", "u52-i06"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i05",
      "te": "రెండు వందలు అంటే ఎక్కువ.",
      "gloss": "Two hundred is too much.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "రెండు", "gloss": "two" },
        { "te": "వందలు", "gloss": "hundreds" },
        { "te": "అంటే", "gloss": "if you say" },
        { "te": "ఎక్కువ", "gloss": "too much" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "bargaining"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u52-i06", "u52-i12"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i06",
      "te": "వంద కి ఇస్తావా భయ్?",
      "gloss": "Will you give it for a hundred, bhai?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "వంద", "gloss": "hundred" },
        { "te": "కి", "gloss": "for" },
        { "te": "ఇస్తావా", "gloss": "will you give?" },
        { "te": "భయ్", "gloss": "bhai (brother)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "bargaining"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "Open at half the quoted price. Nobody is offended — in Laad Bazaar a first quote is an invitation, not a price."
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i07",
      "te": "నక్కో అంటే వేరే షాపు చూస్తా.",
      "gloss": "If it's no, I'll check another shop.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నక్కో", "gloss": "no (Hyderabadi)" },
        { "te": "అంటే", "gloss": "if (you) say" },
        { "te": "వేరే", "gloss": "another" },
        { "te": "షాపు", "gloss": "shop" },
        { "te": "చూస్తా", "gloss": "I'll look (casual)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "bargaining"],
      "difficulty": 4,
      "note": "The walking-away trick: say this, turn slowly, count to three. The price drops before you reach the next shop."
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i08",
      "te": "సరే సరే, ఆగు యార్.",
      "gloss": "Okay okay, wait yaar.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "సరే", "gloss": "okay" },
        { "te": "సరే", "gloss": "okay" },
        { "te": "ఆగు", "gloss": "wait / stop" },
        { "te": "యార్", "gloss": "yaar (friend)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "bargaining"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u52-i07", "u52-i13"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i09",
      "te": "ఈ రంగు తోపు ఉంది.",
      "gloss": "This color is fantastic.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఈ", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "రంగు", "gloss": "color" },
        { "te": "తోపు", "gloss": "great / awesome (Hyderabadi)" },
        { "te": "ఉంది", "gloss": "is" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "flavor"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "తోపు again — the Hyderabadi 'top-class'. Careful: praising the color too early weakens your bargaining position!"
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i10",
      "te": "మ్యాచింగ్ గాజులు చూపించు అన్నా.",
      "gloss": "Show me matching bangles, anna.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మ్యాచింగ్", "gloss": "matching" },
        { "te": "గాజులు", "gloss": "bangles" },
        { "te": "చూపించు", "gloss": "show" },
        { "te": "అన్నా", "gloss": "anna (brother)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "shopping"],
      "difficulty": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i11",
      "te": "క్వాలిటీ చూడు, డిజైన్ చూడు.",
      "gloss": "Look at the quality, look at the design.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "క్వాలిటీ", "gloss": "quality" },
        { "te": "చూడు", "gloss": "look" },
        { "te": "డిజైన్", "gloss": "design" },
        { "te": "చూడు", "gloss": "look" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "shopping"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "The shopkeeper's opening spell. Whatever you do, don't nod — nodding here costs fifty rupees."
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i12",
      "te": "ఇంకో పది తగ్గించు భయ్.",
      "gloss": "Reduce ten more, bhai.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇంకో", "gloss": "another" },
        { "te": "పది", "gloss": "ten" },
        { "te": "తగ్గించు", "gloss": "reduce" },
        { "te": "భయ్", "gloss": "bhai (brother)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "bargaining"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "తగ్గించు is the standard-Telugu 'reduce' — same job as Urdu కమ్ కరో. Hyderabadis use both, sometimes in the same breath."
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i13",
      "te": "బోణీ టైం, తీస్కో అమ్మా.",
      "gloss": "It's boni time, take it, amma.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "బోణీ", "gloss": "first sale of the day" },
        { "te": "టైం", "gloss": "time" },
        { "te": "తీస్కో", "gloss": "take (casual)" },
        { "te": "అమ్మా", "gloss": "amma (madam)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "shopping"],
      "difficulty": 4,
      "note": "బోణీ = the day's first sale, considered lucky. Shopkeepers give real discounts for బోణీ — morning shopping is cheaper. తీస్కో is clipped from తీసుకో."
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i14",
      "te": "ప్యాక్ చెయ్యి, తీస్కుంటా.",
      "gloss": "Pack it, I'll take it.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ప్యాక్", "gloss": "pack" },
        { "te": "చెయ్యి", "gloss": "do / make" },
        { "te": "తీస్కుంటా", "gloss": "I'll take (casual)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "shopping"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "తీస్కుంటా = casual clipped తీసుకుంటాను. Deal closed — but only after the ఆఖరి రేటు, never before.",
      "distractors": ["u52-i04", "u52-i15"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i15",
      "te": "చిల్లర ఉందా మీ దగ్గర?",
      "gloss": "Do you have change on you?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "చిల్లర", "gloss": "change (coins)" },
        { "te": "ఉందా", "gloss": "is there?" },
        { "te": "మీ", "gloss": "your" },
        { "te": "దగ్గర", "gloss": "near / with" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "paying"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u52-i14"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u52-i16",
      "te": "ఇక్కడ బేరం ఆడటం మామూలే.",
      "gloss": "Bargaining here is just normal.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇక్కడ", "gloss": "here" },
        { "te": "బేరం", "gloss": "bargain" },
        { "te": "ఆడటం", "gloss": "playing" },
        { "te": "మామూలే", "gloss": "is normal" }
      ],
      "tags": ["bazaar", "culture"],
      "difficulty": 4,
      "note": "బేరం ఆడు = literally 'play the bargain'. In the old city it's a sport with rules — both sides expect it and enjoy it."
    }
  ],
